    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a data extraction assistant.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON.\nReturn ONLY an array of objects.\nDo NOT add any text, explanation, or formatting.\n\nFields to extract:\n- societe\n- num_facture\n- adresse\n- date\n- reference\n- designation\n- quantite\n- pu\n- tva\n- timbre\n- montant_ttc\n\nRules:\n- societe MUST be \"Baticonfort Mestiri\"\n- adresse MUST be \"Sousse\"\n- Date format must be YYYY-MM-DD\n- Normalize numeric values (keep decimal format)\n- If a field is missing, use null\n\nText to extract from:\n\"\"\"\n{{ $json.text }}\n\"\"\"\n\nReturn EXACTLY this structure:\n[\n  {\n    \"societe\": \"Baticonfort Mestiri\",\n    \"num_facture\": \"<invoice number or null>\",\n    \"adresse\": \"Sousse\",\n    \"date\": \"<YYYY-MM-DD or null>\",\n    \"reference\": \"<reference number or null>\",\n    \"designation\": \"<item description or null>\",\n    \"quantite\": \"<quantity or null>\",\n    \"pu\": \"<unit price without tax or null>\",\n    \"tva\": \"<tax value or null>\",\n    \"timbre\": \"<stamp fee or null>\",\n    \"montant_ttc\": \"<total including tax or null>\"\n  }\n]\n",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [
        1328,
        48
      ],
      "id": "123e82c0-4efe-4169-a6bd-40bb10a76683",
      "name": "Basic LLM Chain"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "executeOnce": false,
        "command": "=powershell -Command \"Get-ChildItem 'D:/4BI4/PI/E-commerce/E-commerce/artisanat/archive_facture/Achat/baticonfort/tmp' -Filter '*{{$('Parse PDF List').item.json.fileName.replace('.pdf','')}}*.png' | ForEach-Object { $fullPath = $_.FullName -replace '\\\\','/'; $json = @{ filePath = $fullPath; fileName = $_.Name } | ConvertTo-Json -Compress; Write-Output $json }\"\n"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeCommand",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        432,
        384
      ],
      "id": "c7aa22f9-0f15-45e7-b4fa-37ef4c678512",
      "name": "Execute Command"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Get all input items\nlet ocrData = $input.all();\n\n// Concatenate all stdout values with a clear separator\nlet combinedText = ocrData\n    .map((entry, index) => `--- transfer Entry ${index + 1} ---\\n${entry.json.stdout}`)\n    .join(\"\\n\\n\");\n\n// Return as a single item to pass to the LLM\nreturn [\n    { json: { text: combinedText } }\n];\n"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1104,
        48
      ],
      "id": "6c0d3aaa-f1a4-409d-8cab-2eee6819f45b",
      "name": "Code"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const data =$input.first().json.output\nconst headers = Object.keys(data[0]);\nconst csvString = [\n  headers.join(\",\"), // header\n  ...data.map(row => headers.map(h => `\"${row[h] !== null ? row[h] : ''}\"`).join(\",\"))\n].join(\"\\n\");\n\nreturn [\n  {\n    json: {}, // empty JSON is fine\n    binary: {\n      data: {\n        data: Buffer.from(csvString, \"utf8\")\n      }\n    }\n  }\n];\n"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
